    <string name="language_system_hint">"Follows your system language (English or Korean). On Android 13+, you can choose a language for this app."</string>
    <string name="usage_steps">"1. Prepare your models\nDownload shared models in Settings. Convert an RVC v2, 48 kHz, f0 voice model with the PC converter, then import its ZIP or send it to the phone.\n\n2. Use without Shizuku\nRecord or import audio on the Convert tab. For live monitoring, select a voice and start Live with headphones.\n\n3. Web calls · No Shizuku\nStart Live conversion with bypass off. Open Web calls, choose a website and sign in. Tap Prepare call audio on the page, then Connect voice to this site. Join a call on the website yourself. Leaving the web screen disconnects forwarding. Site compatibility is experimental.\n\n4. Other apps · Shizuku required\nInstall Shizuku and start it with wireless debugging. Pair using the six-digit code in the Shizuku notification if needed. Return to Shizuku and tap Start; installation alone is not enough. Restart Shizuku after rebooting.\nOpen Virtual mic, allow Shizuku access, mic and notifications, choose your model, then start. Open the destination app and enable its microphone. The app can wait without a start deadline.\n\n5. All apps and Secure Folder\nAll-app input replacement includes supported inputs in Secure Folder. With single-app Other profile mode, enable the destination mic in that profile before starting. Open Secure Folder yourself. Cellular calls and Bluetooth have not been verified.\n\n6. Stop\nStop from the virtual mic screen or its notification. Apps return to their original mic; their calls are not ended. No input means capture and inference pause.\n\nShizuku is optional. Its routing permission is used for virtual mic only; installing the app does not permanently grant system privileges."</string>
    <string name="ui_additional_context">Additional context</string>
    <string name="ui_additional_context_help">Past audio analyzed with each block (0–3 s). More context may improve consistency but requires more processing. Shared by Live and virtual mic; applies next time you start.</string>
